<!--
  PLAN (agreed with Lily):
  - Hook / case study: the Kenyan workers (employed by Sama, in Nairobi) who
    labelled harmful text so that ChatGPT could be made safer. Research notes
    with sources and the disputed points are in notes/ch2-sama-openai-research.md
