    podcast (humans in the loop, feedback), the birdsong/toad example (limits),
    and a short mention that the boundary of what AI can do keeps moving.
  - Chapter 3 (Illusion of Autonomy) gets the Amazon "Just Walk Out" story and
    the Meta moderators' court cases as its hidden-labour examples.
  - The Dutch childcare scandal belongs in the Misuse and Misinterpretation
    chapter.
-->
